{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7f1c2a4-6d3e-4a91-9f22-8c5e0a1d47b3",
    "name": "Hosty — API PostgREST (Supabase)",
    "description": "Colección curada de la API REST de Hosty.\n\nLa API no está escrita a mano: PostgREST la autogenera a partir del esquema de Postgres versionado en `supabase/migrations/*.sql`. El mismo servicio publica su contrato como documento **OpenAPI 2.0 (Swagger)** en `{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/` — ver la carpeta «00 · Contrato OpenAPI (Swagger)».\n\nEsta colección documenta únicamente las operaciones efectivamente invocadas por el frontend (35 invocaciones, ver Tabla 53 del Anexo IV).\n\n## Configuración\n\n1. Definir la variable de entorno `apikey` con la clave publicable (anon) del proyecto de Supabase. **No versionar esa clave dentro de esta colección.**\n2. Para los endpoints marcados como *autenticados*, ejecutar primero `Auth › Sign in with password`: su script de test guarda el `access_token` en la variable `accessToken`, que el resto de las peticiones usa en el encabezado `Authorization`.\n3. Las peticiones anónimas usan `Authorization: Bearer {{apikey}}`; las autenticadas, `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`. Las políticas RLS de Postgres resuelven la autorización por propiedad (`auth.uid()`), sin RBAC.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://gjxextyntxfsztpgkqig.supabase.co",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "apikey",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Clave publicable (anon) del proyecto. Cargar como variable de entorno; no versionar."
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT de sesión. Lo completa automáticamente el request 'Sign in with password'."
    },
    {
      "key": "salonId",
      "value": "22d6e8d4-7162-4d94-a1e8-1fe1d25d241a",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 · Contrato OpenAPI (Swagger)",
      "description": "PostgREST publica el contrato completo de la API en formato OpenAPI (Swagger). Es el equivalente autogenerado de un `swagger.json` escrito a mano: enumera cada tabla como recurso, cada columna como parámetro de filtro y los verbos disponibles.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Documento OpenAPI del esquema public",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/openapi+json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", ""]
            },
            "description": "Devuelve el documento Swagger/OpenAPI autogenerado. Puede importarse directamente en Postman (Import → Link) o en Swagger UI."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 · Salones",
      "description": "Catálogo público. Lectura anónima permitida por política RLS de `SELECT`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Listar salones (paginado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Prefer", "value": "count=exact" },
              { "key": "Range", "value": "0-8" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/salones?select=id,name,location,capacity,price_per_hour,price_type,is_verified,is_featured,rating_value,rating_count,images&order=is_featured.desc,rating_value.desc",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "salones"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "select", "value": "id,name,location,capacity,price_per_hour,price_type,is_verified,is_featured,rating_value,rating_count,images" },
                { "key": "order", "value": "is_featured.desc,rating_value.desc" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "El encabezado `Prefer: count=exact` hace que PostgREST devuelva `Content-Range: 0-8/<total>`, usado por la paginación del catálogo. Respuesta esperada: `206 Partial Content`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Detalle de un salón",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/vnd.pgrst.object+json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/salones?select=*,salon_services(*)&id=eq.{{salonId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "salones"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "select", "value": "*,salon_services(*)" },
                { "key": "id", "value": "eq.{{salonId}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "`Accept: application/vnd.pgrst.object+json` fuerza a PostgREST a devolver un objeto en vez de un array de un elemento. La proyección anidada `salon_services(*)` resuelve la relación por clave foránea en una sola petición."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Buscar por nombre (ilike)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/salones?select=id,name,location&name=ilike.*quinta*",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "salones"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "select", "value": "id,name,location" },
                { "key": "name", "value": "ilike.*quinta*" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Búsqueda por texto insensible a mayúsculas. En el frontend corresponde a `.ilike('name', `%${q}%`)`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Filtrar por capacidad, zona y tipo de evento",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/salones?select=id,name,capacity,location,event_types&capacity=gte.100&location=in.(\"Yerba Buena\",\"San Miguel de Tucumán\")&event_types=ov.{casamientos,corporativo}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "salones"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "select", "value": "id,name,capacity,location,event_types" },
                { "key": "capacity", "value": "gte.100" },
                { "key": "location", "value": "in.(\"Yerba Buena\",\"San Miguel de Tucumán\")" },
                { "key": "event_types", "value": "ov.{casamientos,corporativo}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Combina tres operadores de PostgREST: `gte` (numérico), `in` (conjunto) y `ov` (solapamiento de arrays de Postgres, equivalente a `.overlaps()` en el cliente supabase-js)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 · Auth (GoTrue)",
      "description": "Supabase Auth (GoTrue) es un servicio distinto de PostgREST: cuelga de `/auth/v1`, no de `/rest/v1`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Sign in with password",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', pm.response.json().access_token);",
                  "  pm.test('Devuelve un access_token', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('access_token');",
                  "  });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"<usuario-de-prueba>\",\n  \"password\": \"<contraseña-de-prueba>\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "token"],
              "query": [{ "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" }]
            },
            "description": "Guarda el JWT en `accessToken`. Las credenciales de prueba se cargan como variables de entorno y no se versionan."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Usuario de la sesión actual",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/v1/user",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "user"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 · Reservas (bookings) — autenticado",
      "description": "Todas las operaciones exigen sesión: RLS filtra por `auth.uid()` contra el organizador de la reserva o el anfitrión del salón.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Mis reservas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/bookings?select=*,salones(id,name,location,images)&order=event_date.desc",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "bookings"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "select", "value": "*,salones(id,name,location,images)" },
                { "key": "order", "value": "event_date.desc" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "No lleva filtro por usuario: la política RLS ya restringe las filas visibles a las del usuario autenticado."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Verificar disponibilidad de una fecha",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/bookings?select=id,start_time,end_time,status&salon_id=eq.{{salonId}}&event_date=eq.2026-09-12&status=in.(pending,confirmed)",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "bookings"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "select", "value": "id,start_time,end_time,status" },
                { "key": "salon_id", "value": "eq.{{salonId}}" },
                { "key": "event_date", "value": "eq.2026-09-12" },
                { "key": "status", "value": "in.(pending,confirmed)" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sustenta el paso 1 del wizard de reserva: si la respuesta trae filas con horarios solapados, el paso rechaza la franja elegida."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Crear reserva",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"salon_id\": \"{{salonId}}\",\n  \"event_date\": \"2026-09-12\",\n  \"start_time\": \"20:00\",\n  \"end_time\": \"02:00\",\n  \"attendees\": 80,\n  \"event_type\": \"Casamiento\",\n  \"contact_name\": \"Nombre de prueba\",\n  \"contact_phone\": \"+54 381 000 0000\",\n  \"notes\": \"Reserva creada desde la colección Postman de documentación\",\n  \"status\": \"pending\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/bookings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "bookings"]
            },
            "description": "`Prefer: return=representation` hace que PostgREST devuelva la fila creada (`201 Created`). El campo `status` sólo admite `pending`, `confirmed`, `declined` o `cancelled`: la restricción `bookings_status_check` rechaza cualquier otro valor con `400`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH Cancelar reserva",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"cancelled\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/bookings?id=eq.<id-de-la-reserva>",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "bookings"],
              "query": [{ "key": "id", "value": "eq.<id-de-la-reserva>" }]
            },
            "description": "Un PATCH sin filtro afectaría todas las filas visibles: PostgREST exige el filtro `id=eq.` explícito."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 · Favoritos (user_favorites) — autenticado",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Mis favoritos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/user_favorites?select=salon_id,salones(id,name,location,price_per_hour,images)",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "user_favorites"],
              "query": [{ "key": "select", "value": "salon_id,salones(id,name,location,price_per_hour,images)" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Agregar a favoritos",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"salon_id\": \"{{salonId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/user_favorites",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "user_favorites"]
            },
            "description": "`user_id` no se envía: lo completa el valor por defecto `auth.uid()` de la columna. Repetir la operación devuelve `409 Conflict` por la clave única (`user_id`, `salon_id`)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE Quitar de favoritos",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/user_favorites?salon_id=eq.{{salonId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "user_favorites"],
              "query": [{ "key": "salon_id", "value": "eq.{{salonId}}" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 · Panel del anfitrión — autenticado",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Salones publicados por el anfitrión",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/salones?select=*,bookings(count)&order=created_at.desc",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "salones"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "select", "value": "*,bookings(count)" },
                { "key": "order", "value": "created_at.desc" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ser anfitrión no es un rol: es una consecuencia de poseer filas en `salones`. La política RLS de escritura compara `host_id` con `auth.uid()`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH Responder una reserva recibida",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"confirmed\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/bookings?id=eq.<id-de-la-reserva>",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "bookings"],
              "query": [{ "key": "id", "value": "eq.<id-de-la-reserva>" }]
            },
            "description": "Valores válidos: `confirmed` o `declined`. `declined` sólo es aceptado desde la migración `20260609233130_host_booking_management.sql`, que recreó la restricción `bookings_status_check` (ver defecto documentado en el Anexo V)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Bloquear una fecha del calendario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"salon_id\": \"{{salonId}}\",\n  \"blocked_date\": \"2026-12-25\",\n  \"reason\": \"Mantenimiento\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/salon_availability_blocks",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "salon_availability_blocks"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 · Casos negativos (verificación de RLS)",
      "description": "Peticiones cuyo resultado esperado es un error. Documentan que la autorización se resuelve en la base de datos y no en el cliente.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Reservas sin sesión → 200 con array vacío",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/bookings?select=*",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "bookings"],
              "query": [{ "key": "select", "value": "*" }]
            },
            "description": "Con la clave anónima, RLS no expone ninguna fila: PostgREST responde `200 OK` con `[]`, no `401`. Es el comportamiento esperado y la razón por la que la ausencia de filas no debe interpretarse como una tabla vacía."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Reserva con status inválido → 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"salon_id\": \"{{salonId}}\",\n  \"event_date\": \"2026-09-12\",\n  \"start_time\": \"20:00\",\n  \"end_time\": \"23:00\",\n  \"attendees\": 10,\n  \"status\": \"rejected\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/bookings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "bookings"]
            },
            "description": "`rejected` no pertenece al dominio de `bookings_status_check`. Respuesta esperada: `400` con código `23514` (violación de restricción CHECK)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Tabla inexistente → 404",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{apikey}}" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apikey}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rest/v1/reservas",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rest", "v1", "reservas"],
              "description": "El recurso se llama `bookings`, no `reservas`: PostgREST responde `404` con código `PGRST205`."
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
